k:#79B8FF\">160</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, premium: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quantity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, position: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'short'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">牛市看涨价差收益:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">140</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">145</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">155</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">160</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">165</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">170</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`  股价$${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}: $${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">strategyPayoff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bullCallSpread</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"员工期权与-rsu\">员工期权与 RSU</h2><p>对程序员最直接相关的期权应用是公司股权激励。理解 ISO、NSO 和 RSU 的区别对职业决策至关重要。员工期权本质上是看涨期权——行权价是授予时的公允价格，股价高于行权价时有价值。关键风险是集中度——大量财富集中在单一公司股票上违反了分散投资原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((期权基础))&#10;    基本概念&#10;      Call与Put&#10;      内在价值vs时间价值&#10;      四种基本头寸&#10;    价值决定&#10;      标的价格&#10;      波动率&#10;      到期时间&#10;    策略组合&#10;      保护性看跌&#10;      备兑开仓&#10;      价差策略&#10;    员工期权&#10;      ISO与NSO&#10;      RSU&#10;      集中度风险\">mindmap\n  root((期权基础))\n    基本概念\n      Call与Put\n      内在价值vs时间价值\n      四种基本头寸\n    价值决定\n      标的价格\n      波动率\n      到期时间\n    策略组合\n      保护性看跌\n      备兑开仓\n      价差策略\n    员工期权\n      ISO与NSO\n      RSU\n      集中度风险</pre><ul>\n<li>期权赋予买方权利而非义务，非线性收益特征使其成为最灵活的金融工具</li>\n<li>期权价值由内在价值和时间价值组成，受标的价格、波动率、时间等六个因素影响</li>\n<li>策略组合可以构建出几乎任何想要的风险收益结构</li>\n<li>员工期权是程序员最常接触的期权形式，理解其经济本质有助于做出更好的职业决策</li>\n<li>波动率是期权定价中最关键也最难估计的参数</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../derivatives-pricing/black-scholes-model\">Black-Scholes 模型</a>：期权定价从直觉走向解析公式的关键一步。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../personal-finance-investing/options-basics/option-fundamentals/put-call-parity\">期权基础 · 看跌看涨平价</a>：无套利约束下看涨与看跌期权的内在联系。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../personal-finance-investing/options-basics/strategies/spread-strategies\">期权基础 · 价差策略</a>：把期权积木组合成实际可交易的风险收益结构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"期权基础","id":"期权基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"期权收益结构","id":"期权收益结构"},{"level":2,"text":"期权价值的决定因素","id":"期权价值的决定因素"},{"level":2,"text":"期权策略组合","id":"期权策略组合"},{"level":2,"text":"员工期权与 RSU","id":"员工期权与-rsu"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"股票估值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/financial-engineering/financial-markets/equity-valuation"},"next":{"title":"Black-Scholes 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/financial-engineering/derivatives-pricing/black-scholes-model"}}